%N A398525 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} mu(k)^2/(k*(k+1)), where mu = A008683 is the Möbius function.
%C A398525 This constant appears in the asymptotic formula for A398524.
%H A398525 Olivier Bordellès, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1142/S1793042122501056">On certain sums of number theory</a>, International Journal of Number Theory, Vol. 18, No. 9  (2022), pp. 2053-2074; <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2009.05751v2">arXiv preprint</a>, arXiv:2009.05751 [math.NT], 2020.
%H A398525 Kui Liu, Jie Wu, and Zhishan Yang, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1142/S179304212450043X">On some sums involving the integral part function</a>, International Journal of Number Theory, Vol. 20, No. 3 (2024), pp. 831-847; <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2109.01382">arXiv preprint</a>, arXiv:2109.01382 [math.NT], 2021.
%H A398525 Joshua Stucky, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jnt.2021.09.015">The fractional sum of small arithmetic functions</a>, Journal of Number Theory, Vol. 238 (2022), pp. 731-739; <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2106.14142">arXiv preprint</a>, arXiv:2106.14142 [math.NT], 2021.
%H A398525 Wei Zhang, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/s10986-023-09611-1">On general sums involving the floor function with applications to k-free numbers</a>, Lithuanian Mathematical Journal, Vol. 63 (2023), pp. 547-556; <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2112.06156">arXiv preprint</a>, arXiv:2112.06156 [math.NT], 2021-2023.
%F A398525 Equals Sum_{k>=1} 1/A002378(A005117(k)) (the sum of reciprocals of the squarefree-indexed oblong numbers).
%F A398525 Equals 1/2 + Sum_{k>=2} (-1)^k * (D(k) - 1), where D(s) = zeta(s)/zeta(2*s) is the Dirichlet g.f. of A008966.
%e A398525 0.8918100022767093557474517781621215820159978520717202...
%o A398525 (PARI) suminf(k = 2, (-1)^k * (zeta(k)/zeta(2*k) - 1)) + 1/2
